[I] Qt based client and server SOAP component

[T] KDSoap is a Qt-based client-side and server-side SOAP component. It can
[T] be used to create client applications for web services and also
[T] provides the means to create web services without the need for any
[T] further component such as a dedicated web server.

[U] https://github.com/KDAB/KDSoap

[A] KDAB
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

